  "engineering_rules": [
    "Prefer small coherent modules with explicit interfaces and ownership.","Prefer reusable helpers and reusable workflows over copy-paste families.","Tests must assert behavior or evidence, not incidental wording or implementation text.","A test is not a gate until CI demonstrably executes it.","Production schema and function behavior must remain reconstructable from source control.","No hidden magic score, threshold, authority or deployment rule may remain undocumented.","No new brain, registry, queue, calendar, analytics store or learning store when an existing canonical capability can be extended.","Use current task-relevant external evidence when technology currency can materially change the answer or implementation.","Adopt frontier technology only through a reversible, measurable experiment with rollback or fallback.","Every new verified reusable learning must be deduplicated before persistent write and then refresh current shared context.","Skill and architecture candidates must beat or materially improve the current baseline before promotion and must retain rollback or fallback.","Every autonomous side effect is bounded by explicit risk/cost/capacity/blast-radius policy.","Knowledge that can age must carry freshness and revalidation semantics.","AI/model/prompt/retrieval/agent changes are regression-gated like code changes.","Recovery is proven by restore/rebuild evidence, not by backup existence alone.","Documentation and learning writeback are release outputs, not optional follow-up.","DEELS LIVE is an intermediate signal: keep working until LIVE & BEWEZEN or a proven hard boundary with a complete recovery handoff.","Established Powerhouse authority is reused without repeated approval; agents interrupt only for a genuinely novel unresolved choice or proven hard boundary."
